{"_meta":{"ui":{"resourceUri":"ui://agent-cost-analyzer/views.html"},"ui/resourceUri":"ui://agent-cost-analyzer/views.html"},"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":true},"description":"Lists what the analyzer flagged across every available provider (or one) in a date window, most severe first: security (credential access, pipe-to-shell, destructive or history-rewriting commands, privilege escalation, data upload, ...), anomalies (cost or failure outliers), behavior changes (first use of a program, tool or model) and price changes (kind \"price-change\": GitHub Copilot billing a model steadily above or below the price book, inferred; see get_price_changes). Each finding says what happened, when, in which session and turn, why it was flagged, with redacted evidence. Security findings cover subagent tool calls and name the run (`origin`). Use get_turn to see the context.","inputSchema":{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","properties":{"category":{"description":"Exact category, case-insensitive, e.g. \"credential-access\" or \"cost-outlier\".","type":"string"},"kind":{"description":"Keep only these kinds, e.g. [\"security\"].","items":{"enum":["security","anomaly","behavior-change","price-change"],"type":"string"},"type":"array"},"limit":{"description":"How many of the most recent sessions to read per provider (default 50, max 500).","exclusiveMinimum":0,"maximum":500,"type":"integer"},"maxResults":{"description":"Maximum findings to return (default 50); total and bySeverity count every match.","exclusiveMinimum":0,"maximum":1000,"type":"integer"},"minSeverity":{"description":"Keep findings at or above this severity (info < low < medium < high < critical).","enum":["info","low","medium","high","critical"],"type":"string"},"origin":{"description":"Keep only findings from the main agent or from subagents, e.g. [\"subagent\"]. Default: both.","items":{"enum":["main","subagent"],"type":"string"